      "title": "Read me",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## HyperFlow H3 Flash: first and last frame to video\n\nLoad your images in **First frame** and **Last frame**; the video starts on the first and ends on the last.\n\n**Custom nodes**: [ComfyUI-GGUF](https://github.com/city96/ComfyUI-GGUF) and [ComfyUI-HyperFlow-Flash](https://github.com/Video-Rebirth/ComfyUI-HyperFlow-Flash), on a ComfyUI that has the `MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo` node (0.43 or newer).\n\n**Model files**, in `ComfyUI/models/`:\n\n| Folder | File | From |\n|---|---|---|\n| `diffusion_models/` | `minimax_h3_fl2va_hyperflow_flash_14b-Q4_K_M.gguf` | [VideoRebirthAI/hyperflow-h3-flash](https://huggingface.co/VideoRebirthAI/hyperflow-h3-flash), `fl2va_gguf/` |\n| `text_encoders/` | `qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors` | [Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3) |\n| `vae/` | `minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors`, `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors` | [Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3) |\n\nAnother quant (`Q3_K_M` to `Q8_0`), or the INT8 convrot safetensors (`fl2va_int8_convrot_comfyui/`, no ComfyUI-GGUF needed), works the same: select it in **HyperFlow Loader**.\n\n**Change**: the prompt, size and length in the blue group (length in frames at 24 fps: 124 is 5.2 s); **Seed**; `steps` in **HyperFlow Sigmas** (4 speed, 6 default, 8 quality).\n\n**Keep**: `euler`, CFG 1, no negative prompt. The model was trained for them.\n\n**16 GB or 32 GB of RAM**: start ComfyUI with `--fast-disk` (a ComfyUI newer than 0.43.0).\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## HyperFlow H3 Flash: first and last frame to video\n\nLoad your images in **First frame** and **Last frame**; the video starts on the first and ends on the last.\n\n**Custom nodes**: [ComfyUI-GGUF](https://github.com/city96/ComfyUI-GGUF) and [ComfyUI-HyperFlow-Flash](https://github.com/Video-Rebirth/ComfyUI-HyperFlow-Flash), on a ComfyUI that has the `MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo` node (0.43 or newer).\n\n**Model files**, in `ComfyUI/models/`:\n\n| Folder | File | From |\n|---|---|---|\n| `diffusion_models/` | `minimax_h3_fl2va_hyperflow_flash_14b-Q4_K_M.gguf` | [VideoRebirthAI/hyperflow-h3-flash](https://huggingface.co/VideoRebirthAI/hyperflow-h3-flash), `fl2va_gguf/` |\n| `text_encoders/` | `qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors` | [Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3) |\n| `vae/` | `minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors`, `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors` | [Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3) |\n\nAnother quant (`Q3_K_M` to `Q8_0`), or the INT8 convrot safetensors (`fl2va_int8_convrot_comfyui/`, no ComfyUI-GGUF needed), works the same: select it in **HyperFlow Loader**.\n\n**Change**: the prompt, size and length in the blue group (length in frames at 24 fps: 124 is 5.2 s); **Seed**; `steps` in **HyperFlow Sigmas** (4 speed, 6 default, 8 quality).\n\n**Keep**: `euler`, CFG 1, no negative prompt. The model was trained for them.\n\n**16 GB or 32 GB of RAM**: start ComfyUI with `--fast-disk` (a ComfyUI newer than 0.43.0).\n"
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
